OL,3,GNEWSABake Off contestant reveals who
OL,4,Adoes the washing up
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Great British Bake Off contestant
OL,7,FYannis Ali has revealed who does the
OL,8,Fwashing up on the TV show and the
OL,9,Finspiration behind his week two
OL,10,Fchallenge.
OL,12,FThe 28-year-old paediatrician,
OL,13,Foriginally from London, spent six years
OL,14,Fliving in Norwich while studying
OL,15,Fmedicine at the University of East
OL,16,FAnglia.
OL,18,FHe remains in the competition heading
OL,19,Finto week three of the Channel 4 show.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
