OL,3,GNEWSABake Off contestant reveals who
OL,4,Adoes the washing up
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast week Ali paid homage to his time
OL,7,Fin the region with a biscuit mosaic of
OL,8,Fthe Norfolk Broads. He said: "I spent
OL,9,Fquite a few years living in Norwich and
OL,10,Fwhen you are away from your loved ones
OL,11,Fand your family like I have, your
OL,12,Ffriends become your family and I have
OL,13,Fsuch sweet memories from that region."
